        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Advanced Authoring\n\nMaking reusable parts.\n\n**Node classes.** A reusable kind of node.\n\n**Edge classes.** The kind of a relationship.\n\n**Templates.** The starter graphs a graph begins from.\n\nThis graph is a collection. Each tile is a portal it contains, and what a tile shows (its name, its description, how many pieces it has) is read from the graph behind it, so nothing here is a copy."
